---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Film"
  description="Watch Golden Wings / Fifty Year Flight Path, the documentary on Robyn Stewart’s career as an American Airlines flight attendant."
>
  <section class="hero" aria-label="Film">
    <p class="section__label">Golden Wings</p>
    <h1 class="hero__headline">Fifty Year Flight Path</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">
      One American Airlines family across the 747 rollout, cabin service since
      1971, and the years that remade the job.
    </p>
    <div class="hero__ctas">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://gwingz.com" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >Watch on gwingz.com</a
      >
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/about-the-film">Full story</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <p class="section__label">Synopsis</p>
    <h2 class="section__title">Keep going</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        From girdle checks at stewardess college to golden wings after fifty
        years in the cabin, one American Airlines family carries the 747
        rollout, 9/11, sobriety, and loss across three generations.
      </p>
      <p>
        Robyn Stewart has flown for American Airlines since 1971. Her son Caleb
        directed the film. Jay R. Ricks, her father, was an AA flight engineer
        on the 747 training program. Jock Bethune, an AA media production
        specialist, appears on camera.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
